<!-- Problem Section -->
<section class="problem-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Problem</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">The Payment Processing Industry Is Designed to Confuse You</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Interchange-plus, tiered pricing, basis points, monthly fees, PCI fees, batch fees, statement fees. The complexity is intentional — because the more confused you are, the more they can charge.</p>
    <div class="highlight-box fade-in">
      <ul>
        <li>Square and Stripe charge 2.9% + $0.30 per transaction — on a $50 sale, that is 3.5% effective rate</li>
        <li>Traditional processors bury hidden fees in 8-page statements that nobody reads</li>
        <li>Service businesses using platforms like SimplePractice or Mindbody pay 2.75-3.5% on every transaction</li>
        <li>Therapists, salons, and consultants using integrated billing tools often pay 5-8% without realizing it</li>
        <li>You have been told these rates are "standard" — they are not, they are just common</li>
        <li>Over 5 years, a business doing $200K/year loses $19,000-$70,000 to processing fees</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Solution Section -->
<section class="solution-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Solution</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">1% Flat Rate. Period.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">No interchange-plus calculations. No tiered pricing. No hidden fees. One percent on every transaction. That is it.</p>
    <div class="solution-copy fade-in">
      <p>We are not a standalone payment processor competing on fees. Payment processing is one part of a complete business platform that includes custom websites, CRM, marketing automation, and AI tools. By bundling everything together, we can offer processing rates that standalone companies like Square and Stripe cannot match.</p>
      <p>When you process payments through GullStack, every transaction is connected to your CRM, your customer records, your invoicing, and your reporting dashboard. No manual reconciliation. No exporting CSV files to figure out who paid what. Everything is integrated and automatic.</p>
      <p>And because we believe in transparency, there are zero hidden fees. No setup fees. No monthly minimums. No PCI compliance fees. No statement fees. The rate is 1% per transaction, and you can leave at any time with no cancellation penalties.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

